{"overview":"این باشگاه متعلق به گیس سوارتس است که پسرانش، راساو و ژاک، در کسب‌وکار خانوادگی مشارکت دارند. نوه‌های گیس، کارلا و یوهان نیز برای این باشگاه شنا می‌کنند و تقاضاهای تمرین و مسابقه را مستقیماً به دایرهٔ خانوادگی می‌آورند. آیا گیس می‌تواند مالکیت، انتظارات خانوادگی و جاه‌طلبی ورزشی را طوری مدیریت کند که باشگاه در مسیرهای متفاوت کشیده نشود؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"The club belongs to Gys Swarts, whose sons Rossouw and Jacques are involved in the family enterprise. Gys's grandchildren Karla and Johan also swim for the club, bringing the demands of training and competition directly into the family circle. Can Gys keep ownership, family expectation and sporting ambition from pulling the club in different directions?","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":208,"y":2022,"poster":"/9YpV8H6E0gxp946jPox0Oa53jp6.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":208,"y":2023,"poster":"/22m946xsxRKe8iZd5Qc7EI81FsW.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":208,"y":2024,"poster":"/uvZF598tqnBxC6UsadJsgQVJ7vF.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":208,"y":2025,"poster":"/c3w7Dms8Pfqx5HFT2jjKd1RgO0W.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":37,"y":2026,"poster":"/uF5SpFjMmYTMF0sc5MbjnDsoBcG.jpg"}],"episodes":869,"crew":["Neil McCarthy"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["ZA"],"cast":[{"name":"Justin Strydom","role":"Gys Swarts","photo":"/eSsrFy98hyeAvzTIAxNp8iSdX0h.jpg"},{"name":"Sandi Schultz","role":"Zelda Joubert","photo":"/4ovfpEUckU9uFI3LQDGN4N320Ek.jpg"},{"name":"Nadia Valvekens","role":"Sanet Swarts","photo":"/zDL90RteYQt5BgLfzEwJdkba2Om.jpg"},{"name":"Werner Coetser","role":"Jacques Swarts","photo":"/568xoMd32SiyZcT8rkg50F4sqrB.jpg"},{"name":"Danielle Swanepoel","role":"Karla van der Westhuizen","photo":"/l2mnrMjLYi0MJmgyXLIIh1AQw5E.jpg"},{"name":"Stiaan Bruwer","role":"Henry Paddu","photo":"/yOilTQF0xGc3d2N9HwgvohJcUzF.jpg"},{"name":"Johnny Potsanyane","role":"Tshepo Buti","photo":"/aW1ssXiL939NfOzOJ3s1oH6Wsus.jpg"},{"name":"Stephanie Baartman","rol